  "section_notes": "The final document uses a 5% S2 benchmark with no automatic stop-sale, so Northwind's flagship (6.2%) is protected, and it gives installed units a 6-year retrofit window. Halcyon secured full per-model numeric results for buyers and a 36-month suppression lead time, but accepted a mandatory 8/100,000 recall trigger with no transition, which bites on Ember 8 at 9.9. S1 reporting is strong and unconditional for all thermal incidents."
